-- stderr-contains: help: `make` is a method of trait `Mk` that makes a value: call it on the type, `Int.make(..)`
-- stderr-contains: help: `join` is a method of trait `Mk`: call it as `Mk.join(x, ..)`
-- stderr-contains: :33:11
